# Uni.Note needs NO server secrets and no API keys in the browser build.
# Firebase web configuration lives in firebase-applet-config.json (public
# project identifiers, not credentials). Security is enforced by the
# deployed firestore.rules / storage.rules — deploy them before use:
#   firebase deploy --only firestore:rules,storage --project steadfast-rigging-g2w8r
#
# Optional, self-hosted Express server only:
# ENABLE_LOCAL_UPLOADS=true   # enables POST /api/upload-image (off by default)
# UPLOAD_TOKEN=change-me      # if set, uploads must send header x-upload-token
